---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Get Cited & editorial policy | Get Cited" description="Who publishes this research explainer, how its evidence is selected, and how corrections are handled.">
  <main id="main-content" class="policy mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-10">
    <header><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-blue-800">Get Cited project</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About Get Cited &amp; editorial policy</h1></header>
    <p>Get Cited is a public hackathon research explainer about the environmental footprint of generative AI. The project repository is maintained by <a href="https://github.com/Shubhankar639-bit">Shubhankar639-bit</a>. It synthesizes published evidence; it is not an academic institution, an independent laboratory, or a peer-reviewed publication.</p>
<h2>How we handle evidence</h2><p>We prioritize original research and official environmental guidance. Every quantitative result identifies its source and workload. Modeled estimates, vendor measurements, and benchmark averages are labeled separately. We do not treat incompatible measurement boundaries as a controlled comparison.</p>
<h2>Review and limitations</h2><p>The cited findings and source metadata were checked on 14 October 2026. This review confirms what the selected publications report; it does not independently reproduce their measurements. Sources may later be corrected, and the review is not an exhaustive systematic literature review.</p>
<h2>Editorial accountability</h2><p>Authorship is attributed to the Get Cited project without invented expert credentials. This explainer was prepared with AI assistance and source checks. Public <a href="https://github.com/Shubhankar639-bit/genesis-final-prototype/commits/main/">revision history</a> records changes. <a href="/contact/">Submit corrections</a> with primary evidence; confirmed corrections should update the article and its review date.</p>
<h2>Reuse and citation</h2><p>Link to the <a href="/#section-g-sources">article and original references</a>. This website does not grant rights to the papers it cites. Structured data supports interpretation; it does not guarantee rankings, indexing, or AI citations.</p>
    <p><a href="/">Return to the evidence review</a></p>
  </main>
  <footer class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-8 text-sm text-slate-600">Get Cited project · Updated <time datetime="2026-10-14">14 October 2026</time></footer>
</Layout>
<style>.policy :global(p), .policy :global(ol) { margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; } .policy :global(h2) { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; } .policy :global(a) { color: #1e40af; text-decoration: underline; } .policy :global(ol) { list-style: decimal; padding-left: 1.5rem; }</style>
